      "desc": "Norma has evoked the Mindscape: <color=#FFAF2C>[Visionary Extremism]</color>.\n[Visionary Extremism]: The duration of the En-Nah Turret's missile bay deployed by <color=#FFFFFF>EX Special Attack: Explosive Experiment</color> increases to 12s. When an Armor-Piercing Warhead or High-Explosive Warhead from any skill hits an enemy, the target's All-Attribute RES is reduced by 15% for 15s. Repeated triggers reset the duration.",
